      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5211,
      "text": "Obey Allah and obey the Messenger, but if you turn away, then the duty of Our Messenger is only to convey the message clearly.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 557,
      "ruku": 491,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5212,
      "text": "Allah, none has the right to be worshiped except Him. So in Allah let the believers put their trust.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 557,
      "ruku": 491,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5213,
      "text": "O you who believe, indeed, among your wives and your children are some who are enemies[2] to you, so beware of them. But if you pardon and overlook, and forgive, then Allah is indeed All-Forgiving, Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 557,
      "ruku": 491,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5214,
      "text": "Your wealth and your children are but a trial, and with Allah is a great reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 557,
      "ruku": 491,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5215,
      "text": "So fear Allah as much as you can, listen and obey, and spend in charity; that is better for your souls. Whoever is protected from the stinginess of his soul, it is they who are successful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 28,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 557,
      "ruku": 491,
      "hizbQuarter": 222,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5216,
      "text": "If you lend Allah a goodly loan, He will multiply it for you and forgive you, for Allah is Most Appreciative[3], Most Forbearing,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 64,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّغَابُنِ",
        "englishName": "At-Taghaabun",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Mutual Disillusion",
        "numberOfAyahs": 18,
